		(property "Description" "Raspberry Pi CM5 carrier board. Footprints options of 0mm clearance and 2.5mm module clearance. Use connector 10164227-1001A1RLF for short stackup hieght. Use connector 10164227-1004A1RLF for tall stackup height. Use standoff 9774015151R for short standoff options. Use standoff 9774040151R for tall standoff options. Options with Pads are connected to Pin 1 (GND) of CM connector."
